{"id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral-data.md","title":"Measurable Time-Integral and Filtration Data","display":"df-stochastic-integral-data — Measurable Time-Integral and Filtration Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stochastic-integral-data","aliases":["58-df-stochastic-integral-data"],"display":"df-stochastic-integral-data — Measurable Time-Integral and Filtration Data","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stochastic-integral-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stochastic-integral-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stochastic-integral-data — Measurable Time-Integral and Filtration Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f0355544d1bb59cc\" href=\"?note=f0355544d1bb59cc\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md\">../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6ad876d2c15e685f\" href=\"?note=6ad876d2c15e685f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md\">../batch15/58-df-derivative.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(T=\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,H,X,Y,Z,t,r,J,h,B\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,H,X,Y,Z,t,r,J,h,B\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_t=\\{A\\cap[0,t]:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_t=\\{A\\cap[0,t]:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_t=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_t\">\\(\\lambda_t=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\{(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\land a&lt;b\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\{(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathbb Q\\land a&lt;b\\})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}(\\{[0,a):a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\infty]:a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\})\">\\(\\mathcal B_+=\\sigma_{[0,\\infty]}(\\{[0,a):a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\}\\cup\\{(a,\\infty]:a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>非负积分取自 <code>58-df-integral</code>；乘方、差、截断和正负部分均按下列显式函数图使用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\">\\(X\\in(\\mathbb R^\\Omega)^T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathbb R^{T\\times\\Omega},\\ w\\in\\Omega,t\\in T\">\\(H\\in\\mathbb R^{T\\times\\Omega},\\ w\\in\\Omega,t\\in T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(f)\">\\(D(f)\\)</span> 为 <code>58-df-derivative</code> 中的导数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f0355544d1bb59cc\" href=\"?note=f0355544d1bb59cc\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md\">../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6ad876d2c15e685f\" href=\"?note=6ad876d2c15e685f\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md\">../batch15/58-df-derivative.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LTwoRandomVariable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LTwoRandomVariable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\">\\(\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(X,\\Omega)\n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,X(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{JointProcessGraph}_S(X,\\Omega)\n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle s,w\\rangle,X(s)(w)\\rangle:s\\in T\\land w\\in\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t)\n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t)\n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle s,H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(Y;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(Y;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J,h,t)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land J\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(h;([0,t],\\mathcal L_t),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,|h(s)|\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land J=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\max(h(s),0)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\n-\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\max(-h(s),0)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J,h,t)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land J\\in\\mathbb R\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(h;([0,t],\\mathcal L_t),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,|h(s)|\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t&lt;\\infty\\\\\n&amp;\\land J=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\max(h(s),0)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\n-\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,\\max(-h(s),0)\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,H,t,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J(w),\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t),t).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PathwiseTimeIntegral}_S(J,H,t,\\Omega)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(J,\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\n\\mathrm{TimeIntegralValue}_S(J(w),\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t),t).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A\\in[0,\\infty]^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(A;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t);([0,t],\\mathcal L_t),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land A(w)=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\\Bigr)\n\\land r=\\int_\\Omega A\\,d\\mathbb P\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TimeSquareNormValue}_S(r,H,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;t\\in T\\land r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(H,T\\times\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A\\in[0,\\infty]^\\Omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(A;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall w\\in\\Omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\mathrm{ProcessSection}_S(H,w,t);([0,t],\\mathcal L_t),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land A(w)=\\int_{[0,t]}\\{\\langle s,H(\\langle s,w\\rangle)^2\\rangle:s\\in[0,t]\\}\\,d\\lambda_t\\Bigr)\n\\land r=\\int_\\Omega A\\,d\\mathbb P\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;r\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land r=\\int_\\Omega\\{\\langle w,Y(w)^2\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\,d\\mathbb P.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;r\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{RealRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land r=\\int_\\Omega\\{\\langle w,Y(w)^2\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\}\\,d\\mathbb P.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LTwoRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LTwoRandomVariable}_S(Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{RandomSquareNormValue}_S(r,Y,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s&lt;t\\to\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;\n\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl[E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:B(t)(w)-B(s)(w)\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land\\mathbb P(A\\cap E)=\\mathbb P(A)\\mathbb P(E)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BrownianWithFiltration}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}_S(\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\Bigl(s&lt;t\\to\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F_\\bullet(s)\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\;\n\\exists E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl[E=\\{w\\in\\Omega:B(t)(w)-B(s)(w)\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{58mm}\\land\\mathbb P(A\\cap E)=\\mathbb P(A)\\mathbb P(E)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(D(f),\\mathbb R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TwiceContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(D(f),\\mathbb R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原五元 <code>BrownianMotion_S</code> 的对象；新增的五元谓词单独表达增量相对于指定滤过的独立性。不能只从适应性推出该性质。</li>\n<li>平方范数值允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span>；有限性由调用处明确提出，不把某个随机变量的不可测性或无穷积分藏在期望符号中。</li>\n<li>时间积分为逐路径 Lebesgue 积分；函数图及正负部分明确给出。本节不参与定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md","status":"resolved","id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-derivative.md","status":"resolved","id":"6ad876d2c15e685f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md","status":"resolved","id":"f0355544d1bb59cc","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{FilteredProbabilitySpace}$ 取 [[../batch01/58-df-semimartingale.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-